han fun audition  experience he explained I read twice and  I left sweating in a total panic I  called my agent Brian swordstrom and I  said Brian I thought about this a lot  and I have to go back and knock on that  door and read again chalamet thought he  hadn't done a good job his agent  cautioned to me against going into the  room and ultimately chalamet did not get  the role number four Jake Gyllenhaal  failed his quest of audition for the  role of Frodo in Lord of the Rings and  well they said they need a hobbit we  thought Jake he describes his audition  experience saying the first scene had no  lines and was simply staged directions  that told him to look at the ring not  knowing the context Jake didn't realize  the gravity of the scene and glanced  over the imaginary ring in a casual and  almost flippant fashion so I sort of  like walked up and I like sort of opened  it up and I was like  is that good he did get to speak in the  other audition scenes but similarly  misunderstood the audition when he  didn't prepare an accent for the role  director Peter Jackson allegedly joked  with him saying you are the worst actor  however he's like did anyone tell you're  supposed to have an accent number five  just because you're auditioning to play  a pirate doesn't mean you should get  into the Grog too early this audition  experience almost sounds like a method  actor preparing the night before his  audition for William Bill Turner and the  Pirates of the Caribbean Act Dr Tom  Hiddleston went out partying Hiddleston  admitted he got drunk the night before  to celebrate a friend's final exams and  was hungover at his audition the next  day but he was up against more than just  a hangover Tom had received the script  only the day before and hadn't even  memorized his lines  number six Full House of dragons sorry  we had to auditioning for the role of  Daenerys in Game of Thrones was less  than fun for actor Elizabeth Olsen right  I auditioned for Game of Thrones who  described her experience saying that she  auditioned for the assistant to the  casting director and did the Khaleesi  speech when she comes out of the fire  and calling her audition awful and that  was the furthest I got it was that bad  number seven the Star Wars movies have  played host to a number of peculiar  characters so it's no surprise to hear  that Eddie Redmayne found himself  auditioning for one and he describes his  audition experience as having made a  fatal mistake he says he put on a  ridiculous voice that was a really  hilarious moment because it was Nina  Gold who I have to thank a lot because  she's cast me in several films and she  was just sitting there and I was trying  again and again with different versions  of my  bye  voice and after like 10 shots she's like  you got anything else I was like no Adam  Driver got the part which was great for  not only the Star Wars universe but the  universe generally number eight it turns  out she's not all that actor Emma Stone  could have been a cast member on all  that but wasn't prepared enough for her  audition she thought she'd be given  sketches but five minutes before she was  told she needed to have three characters  prepared so I was like okay and then I  made up a couple of characters but in  the face of the prepared competition it  was just not enough to get her a role we  are still all that to us Emma number  nine for a superhero sometimes it all  comes down to the costume John came so  close to Landing the title role of  Captain America that he made it as far  as the costume fitting it's a pretty big  day for me his big fail moment came  after the audition and during the  costume fitting Jon describes trying to  get the costumes past his hips when  Chris Hemsworth passed and said all  right mate and I went I'm good this is  stupid  John jokes that he immediately started  taking the suit off saying he was just  like jacked he was like you're gonna  look great in that suit and I was like  don't make fun of me Hemsworth number  10. Casino Royale was a big gamble for  actor Henry Cavill he describes his  audition for the role of James Bond in  the movie saying I probably could have  prepared better in the audition Henry  describes reenacting a scene from a  prior James Bond film where Bond wore  only a towel I remember the director  Martin Campbell saying looking a little  chubby there Henry I didn't know how to  train or diet and I'm glad Martin said  something because I respond well to the  truth it helps me get better how do you  take your Martini just shaking not stood  number 11 could you imagine Eight Mile  with Seth Rogen Seth missed out on a  role in Eminem's hit movie because he  started giggling during his audition he  explains that he auditioned twice  because his first audition failed to  impress the casting director with his  rappery dialogue Seth was asked to bring  someone with him to the second audition  he came back having brought Jason Siegel  with him Seth said we asked our agents  if our auditions could be scheduled one  right after the other so that one of us  could audition for cheddar with the  other reading the Rabbit part and then  we'd switch but Rogan got a case of the  giggles at the audition and couldn't  shake it off at all number 12. what do  Borat and Puss in Boots have in common  Prince Caspian of course actor Nicholas  Holt had a rough time with his audition  for the role of Prince Caspian and the  Narnia series the actor called The  Audition one of my all-time worst saying  he was asked to do a Spanish accent and  modeled it off of Puss in Boots from  Shrek Nicholas explained I was trying to  do my Antonio Banderas impression saying  I am Prince Caspian it was horrendous it  sounded more like Borat number 13. in an  audition there's a fine line between  doing it your way and doing it the way  the casting director wants to see it  actor Eddie Redmayne walked that line  during his audition for Bilbo in The  Hobbit and didn't wan